{
  "project": "袴田事件：58年",
  "voice_id": "voice-00",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "completed": 10,
  "planned": 30,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "text": "2024年9月26日清晨，静冈地院外，人群等待宣判。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S01.mp3",
      "bytes": 48710,
      "sha256": "72790c5b3775701f0bd9327c3b03af8f5455f57a6937dcf2e4bdc6a40e9ced0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "text": "他等了五十八年，才等来一句无罪。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S02.mp3",
      "bytes": 31782,
      "sha256": "e1262867b28977f8cf8f463477f12c835ba508da18f11b5186536c938ffa675f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "text": "1966年6月30日深夜，静冈一栋住宅起火。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S03.mp3",
      "bytes": 39724,
      "sha256": "7f9cc8a39bc602116b91a2fd475650ee20697ab57c52794344d971a3b16d2b9a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "text": "消防车赶到，警灯穿过浓烟，火势吞没街区的夜色。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S04.mp3",
      "bytes": 46202,
      "sha256": "71e8899a54401454bb6217dfd2b3c2c1b16783f99986493a8451e16912daa327"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "text": "黎明后，警方确认一家四口遇害，现场展开勘查。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S05.mp3",
      "bytes": 38261,
      "sha256": "de05eeef33f2e61e5c30372158303491901f9bebdd81042671be2ee54fdf2167"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "text": "屋内现金失踪，警方据此以强盗杀人案立案。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S06.mp3",
      "bytes": 45575,
      "sha256": "738470f8080615a44feea7cd7fba3373d11e34669e641a789e9e5a4e8b5ab1ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "text": "八月，警方逮捕味噌厂员工袴田岩，时年三十岁。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S07.mp3",
      "bytes": 47874,
      "sha256": "d0e5d0741b7b62381289d8388eec912ed3ae5f0adff499bbfb6aefc8e1bdbf05"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "text": "前拳击手袴田没有反抗，平静地跟随警方离开。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S08.mp3",
      "bytes": 33245,
      "sha256": "4a12a0ebbe1edffebd3fd6c33aaa93701ce027da17ffed63836c654edd1c748b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "text": "连续数周，他每天接受十多个小时审讯，日夜交替。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S09.mp3",
      "bytes": 41395,
      "sha256": "b172e6049fc2d59807450cc14eff59253939aea49f64c848f334419181a8cfe7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "text": "长讯问后，他签下口供；庭审上却否认杀人。",
      "file": "audio/voice00/S10.mp3",
      "bytes": 37007,
      "sha256": "ec5420b7319b7c608974aac00f176df25ec5c313ebf8e7a5192226aed36c9327"
    }
  ]
}
